
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_RECLAIM_THE_BELOVED]
Reclaim the Beloved

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_RECLAIM_THE_BELOVED_desc]
The confusion of the past has long sunk into silence, buried deep within sorrow.\nThrough storms and hardship, the Pie family of the Rock Farm and the townsfolk beneath them have stood together, growing stronger with every trial.\nMaud Pie remains unshaken — steadfast as ever.\nOnce more, we rise in the name of Harmony.\nBut this time, the Empire shall repay our suffering — twice over.

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_RECLAIM_THE_BELOVED]
夺回所爱

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_RECLAIM_THE_BELOVED_desc]
昔日的迷茫，早已沉入心底，化作沉默无声的哀伤。风雨交加的岁月中，采石农场的派家族与他们的镇民并肩共度苦难，在磨砺中愈发坚韧，这一次，帝国将加倍偿还。
